#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:2
msgid ":mod:`microdot.csrf` --- CSRF protection"
msgstr ":mod:`microdot.csrf` --- CSRF-skydd"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:7
msgid ""
"Rejects state-changing requests that originate cross-site. The check runs as"
" a ``before_request`` hook and uses the browser-supplied ``Sec-Fetch-Site`` "
"header (with the ``Origin`` header as a fallback for older browsers, when "
"paired with a :class:`microdot.cors.CORS` instance)."
msgstr ""
"Avvisar tillståndsändrande begäranden som har sitt ursprung från en annan "
"webbplats. Kontrollen körs som en ``before_request``\\ -hook och använder "
"det webbläsarlämnade huvudet ``Sec-Fetch-Site`` (med huvudet ``Origin`` som "
"reserv för äldre webbläsare, när det paras med en "
":class:`microdot.cors.CORS`\\ -instans)."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:14
msgid "class CSRF"
msgstr "class CSRF"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:18
msgid "*app*"
msgstr "*app*"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:19
msgid ""
"The :class:`microdot.Microdot` instance to install on. Optional; call "
":meth:`initialize` later if not given."
msgstr ""
"Instansen :class:`microdot.Microdot` att installera på. Valfri; anropa "
":meth:`initialize` senare om den inte anges."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:22
msgid "*cors*"
msgstr "*cors*"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:23
msgid ""
"The :class:`microdot.cors.CORS` instance that defines the application's "
"trusted origins. Required for falling back to the ``Origin`` header on "
"browsers that do not send ``Sec-Fetch-Site``. Optional; without it, only the"
" ``Sec-Fetch-Site`` check applies."
msgstr ""
"Instansen :class:`microdot.cors.CORS` som definierar applikationens betrodda"
" ursprung. Krävs för att falla tillbaka på huvudet ``Origin`` på webbläsare "
"som inte skickar ``Sec-Fetch-Site``\\ . Valfri; utan den gäller endast "
"kontrollen av ``Sec-Fetch-Site``\\ ."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:29
msgid "*protect_all*"
msgstr "*protect_all*"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:30
msgid ""
"If ``True`` (default), every route except ``GET``, ``HEAD``, and ``OPTIONS``"
" is protected automatically. Routes can be exempted individually with "
":meth:`exempt`. If ``False``, no routes are protected by default and "
"individual routes opt in with :meth:`protect`."
msgstr ""
"Om ``True`` (standard) skyddas varje rutt utom ``GET``\\ , ``HEAD`` och "
"``OPTIONS`` automatiskt. Rutter kan undantas individuellt med "
":meth:`exempt`\\ . Om ``False`` skyddas inga rutter som standard och "
"enskilda rutter ansluter sig med :meth:`protect`\\ ."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:36
msgid "*allow_subdomains*"
msgstr "*allow_subdomains*"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:37
msgid ""
"If ``True``, requests from subdomains of the application's origins are "
"accepted (``same-site`` Sec-Fetch-Site, or matching origin suffix)."
msgstr ""
"Om ``True`` accepteras begäranden från subdomäner till applikationens "
"ursprung (\\ ``same-site`` Sec-Fetch-Site, eller matchande ursprungssuffix)."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:43
msgid "Attach to *app* if construction was deferred."
msgstr "Koppla till *app* om konstruktionen sköts upp."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:47
msgid ""
"Decorator that exempts a route from CSRF protection. Place it directly after"
" the route decorator::"
msgstr ""
"Dekorator som undantar en rutt från CSRF-skydd. Placera den direkt efter "
"rutt-dekoratorn::"

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:57
msgid ""
"Decorator that forces CSRF protection on a route that would otherwise be "
"exempt (e.g. a ``GET`` route or every route when ``protect_all=False``)."
msgstr ""
"Dekorator som framtvingar CSRF-skydd på en rutt som annars skulle vara "
"undantagen (t.ex. en ``GET``\\ -rutt eller varje rutt när "
"``protect_all=False``\\ )."

#: ../../library/microdot.csrf.rst:64
msgid ""
"Class attribute listing methods that are not protected by default -- "
"``['GET', 'HEAD', 'OPTIONS']``."
msgstr ""
"Klassattribut som listar metoder som inte skyddas som standard -- ``['GET', "
"'HEAD', 'OPTIONS']``\\ ."

